---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { consoles } from '../data/consoles';
---
<SiteLayout title="Service de consolas y joysticks en Floresta | PCLAF" description="Service preventivo de PlayStation, Xbox y reparación de joysticks en Floresta. Consultá precios y pedí turno en PCLAF.">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/pclaf-nav.css" />
    <script src="/assets/pclaf-nav.js" defer></script>
  </Fragment>
  <div class="hub console-main"><main class="hub-home"><section class="hub-intro"><span class="hub-kicker">PCLAF / SERVICE Y REPARACIÓN</span><h1>Tu consola,<br /><span>lista para jugar.</span></h1><p>Limpieza y mantenimiento térmico para bajar temperatura y ruido, más reparación de joysticks con limpieza, revisión de drift y cambio de sticks cuando hace falta.</p></section><section class="console-groups"><article class="console-group console-group-ps"><span class="group-kicker">01 · SONY</span><h2>PlayStation</h2><div class="console-grid">{consoles.filter((item) => item.shortName.toLowerCase().includes('ps')).map((item) => <a class="console-card" href={`/consolas/${item.slug}.html`}><small>{item.shortName}</small><strong>{item.name}</strong><p>{item.includes}</p><b>{item.price} →</b></a>)}</div></article><article class="console-group console-group-xbox"><span class="group-kicker">02 · MICROSOFT</span><h2>Xbox</h2><div class="console-grid">{consoles.filter((item) => item.shortName.toLowerCase().includes('xbox')).map((item) => <a class="console-card" href={`/consolas/${item.slug}.html`}><small>{item.shortName}</small><strong>{item.name}</strong><p>{item.includes}</p><b>{item.price} →</b></a>)}</div></article><article class="console-group console-group-joystick"><span class="group-kicker">03 · PERIFÉRICOS</span><h2>Joysticks</h2><div class="console-grid"><a class="console-card" href="/turnos.html?servicio=joystick"><small>🕹️ DRIFT Y MANTENIMIENTO</small><strong>Reparación de joystick</strong><p>Mano de obra y limpieza para prevenir drift. Si no alcanza, evaluamos el cambio del stick.</p><b>$65.000 · Pedir turno →</b></a><div class="console-card console-card-note"><small>VALORES DE REFERENCIA</small><p><strong>Drift 1 stick:</strong> $40.000 · <strong>2 sticks:</strong> $80.000<br /><strong>Limpieza sin drift:</strong> $25.000–30.000<br />Placa, pads, pistas, USB, batería, gatillos o botones: presupuesto.</p></div></div></article></section></main><footer><span>© 2026 PCLAF / FLORESTA</span><a href="/precios.html#consolas">Ver precios →</a></footer></div>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700;800;900&family=Barlow:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap');:global(*){box-sizing:border-box}:global(body){margin:0;background:#080808;color:#f0f0f0;font-family:'Barlow',sans-serif}:global(a){color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.console-main{--red:#cc0000;--line:#252525;min-height:100vh;background:#080808}.hub-home{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 24px 48px}.hub-intro{text-align:center;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto 32px}.hub-kicker,.group-kicker,.console-card small{font:10px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#cc0000;text-transform:uppercase}.hub-intro h1{font:900 clamp(44px,7vw,76px)/.88 'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;margin:18px 0 14px}.hub-intro h1 span{color:#cc0000}.hub-intro p{margin:0;color:#888;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5}.console-groups{display:grid;gap:15px}.console-group{padding:24px;border:1px solid #252525;border-radius:12px;background:#111}.console-group-ps{border-top:3px solid #2878e8}.console-group-xbox{border-top:3px solid #28b85b}.console-group h2{font:800 39px/.9 'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;margin:14px 0 20px}.console-group-ps h2{color:#6ea6ff}.console-group-xbox h2{color:#53d88e}.console-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.console-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:150px;padding:18px;background:#0b0b0b;border:1px solid #252525;border-radius:10px}.console-card strong{margin:16px 0 8px;font:700 25px/.9 'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif}.console-card p{margin:0 0 14px;color:#888;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4}.console-card b{margin-top:auto;color:#6ea6ff;font:14px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace}.console-group-xbox .console-card b{color:#53d88e}.console-card:hover{background:#171717}.hub footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:24px;color:#444;font:10px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;border-top:2px solid #cc0000}.hub footer a{color:#888}@media(max-width:650px){.hub-home{padding:22px 16px 40px}.console-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hub footer{margin:0 16px;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}}
  .console-group-joystick{order:-1;border-top-color:#a855f7}.console-group-joystick h2{color:#c084fc}.console-group-joystick .console-card{border-color:rgba(168,85,247,.42)}.console-group-joystick .console-card b{color:#c084fc}.console-group-joystick .console-card:hover{background:#171026}.console-group-joystick .group-kicker,.console-group-ps .group-kicker,.console-group-xbox .group-kicker{font-size:0}.console-group-joystick .group-kicker::after{content:'01 · PERIFÉRICOS';font-size:10px}.console-group-ps .group-kicker::after{content:'02 · SONY';font-size:10px}.console-group-xbox .group-kicker::after{content:'03 · MICROSOFT';font-size:10px}
</style>
<style>
  /* Ficha de referencia: conserva el sistema de tarjetas y ordena solo su contenido. */
  .console-card-note p{display:block!important;margin:0!important;font-size:0;line-height:0;color:transparent!important}
  .console-card-note p strong{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:8px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #242424;font:700 20px/.95 'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;color:#b9b9b9}
  .console-card-note p strong::after{font:500 13px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#c084fc;white-space:nowrap}
  .console-card-note p strong:nth-of-type(1)::after{content:'$40.000'}
  .console-card-note p strong:nth-of-type(2)::after{content:'$80.000'}
  .console-card-note p strong:nth-of-type(3)::after{content:'$25.000–30.000'}
  .console-card-note p::after{content:'Placa, pads, pistas, USB, batería, gatillos o botones: presupuesto.';display:block;padding-top:5px;font:12px/1.35 'Barlow',sans-serif;color:#888}
  @media(max-width:650px){.console-card-note p strong{font-size:19px}.console-card-note p strong::after{font-size:12px}}
</style>
